OL,3,GNEWSAReform expels councillor after
OL,4,AFacebook post trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: Some readers may find language
OL,7,Fin this story offensive
OL,9,FA councillor convicted over a "grossly
OL,10,Foffensive" Facebook post about the
OL,11,FNigerian community has been expelled
OL,12,Ffrom his party.
OL,14,FReform UK confirmed it had expelled
OL,15,FSunderland City Councillor Glenn
OL,16,FGibbins following the conclusion of his
OL,17,Ftrial on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
