OL,3,GNEWSAReform expels councillor after
OL,4,AFacebook post trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FGibbins was convicted of a malicious
OL,7,Fcommunication over the post made in
OL,8,FMarch 2024, which came to light two
OL,9,Fyears later when he was elected to
OL,10,Frepresent the Hylton Castle ward. He
OL,11,Fwas sentenced to a 12-month community
OL,12,Forder with 150 hours of unpaid work.
